#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:31 3797b532bfda4419bf69a95567f63786
msgid ""
"If your account is upgraded to the Premium or Custom – you might be able "
"to customize your project mapping workflows and some of their options."
msgstr ""
"Если ваш аккаунт обновлён до уровня Premium или Custom, вы можете "
